  "reminder": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\"><meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light dark\">\n<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark;supported-color-schemes:light dark}@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){body,.bg{background:#111 !important;color:#f2f2f2 !important}.muted,.muted a,.fb{color:#a8a8a8 !important}.quote{border-left-color:#444 !important;color:#d8d8d8 !important}.btn{background:#fff !important;color:#111 !important;border-color:#fff !important}}</style>\n</head><body style=\"margin:0;background:#fff\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all\">A quick nudge about a connection request.&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;</div>\n<div class=\"bg\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:480px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px 20px;background:#fff;color:#111;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5\">\n<!--body-->\n<h1 style=\"font-size:28px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.03em;margin:0 0 16px\">{{ .Requester }} is still waiting</h1>\n<p>Hi {{ .Name }},</p>\n<p>A quick nudge about the note from {{ .Requester }} at {{ .Org }}. You can say yes or no, and either answer is fine. The link expires in about a day.</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:24px 0\"><tr><td><a class=\"btn\" href=\"{{ .Link }}\" style=\"d